$DATUM N-(O-Nitrobenzylideneamino)bicyclo[2.2.1]-hept-2-ene-endo-5,endo-6-dicarboximide
(VII). A mixture of 0.50 g (2.8 mmol) of aminoimide III and 0.42 g (2.8
mmol) of O-nitrobvenzaldehyde in ethanol was heated at reflux for 6 h.
The light-yellow crystals precipitated on cooling were filtered off,
dried in air, andrecrystallized from 96% ethanol. Compound VII, yield
67%. mp 136-137°C, Rf 0.60 (ether). IR spectrum, cm-1: 3070, 1740,1615,
1540, 1360, 1340, 1190, 710. Found, %: N 13.47. C16H13N3O4. Calculated,
%: N 13.50.
